# A brand rides the ENEMY, as GMS's does: every Blast that strikes one brands
# it, and the fifth brand detonates on that enemy alone, on top of the strike
# that set it off. So a boss with several bodies is worth several detonations,
# and a monster that dies at four brands is worth none -- which is the reading
# a passive for bossing wants.
#
# GMS's own ladder, 502+4x%. At master level the detonation is 6220% against
# Blast's own 3400%, so a Blast that sets one off lands nearly twice what the
# four before it did -- and it is the number to trim first if the Paladin
# outgrows the Dark Knight.
#
# Its 20% ignored defence is the point of the skill. It rides the swing alone,
# which is what an ied_pct on an attack means -- see WithoutSwingLevers.
name: "Divine Judgment"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Marks enemies struck by your Blast skill with a Divine Brand. Upon "
  "reaching the max number of stacks, the Divine Brands detonate, inflicting "
  "additional damage that ignores some of the enemy's Defense."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN
max_level: 30
exceeds_master_level: true
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Blast"
  level: 5
}
boosts_skill_name: "Blast"
empowered_form {
  casts_per_trigger: 5
  brands_each_enemy: true
  lines: 10
  base {
    skill_pct: 5.06
    ied_pct: 0.20
  }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
}
